${session.results
  .map(result => {
    const scenario = session.scenarios.find(s => s.id === result.scenarioId);
    return `
### ${scenario?.name || result.scenarioId}
- **Status:** ${result.passed ? '✅ PASSED' : '❌ FAILED'}
